  "format_finding": "The inspected blastdb ASN schema and writer use one Blast-db-mask-info object with one consolidated mask list and more=false. Writer Print buffers per-sequence masks, and the destructor consolidates and serializes. This establishes the current inspected source format; it is not permission to concatenate unknown streams or a claim that binary parsing is implemented.",
